                        <svg className="w-16 h-16 text-slate-200 mx-auto mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
                        <p className="text-[11px] font-black text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-widest leading-relaxed">No Visual Proof<br/>Provided by Agent</p>
